# OpenAI API Key Configuration
# Add your OpenAI API key after the equals sign below:
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Example:
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-actual-api-key-here

# Instructions:
# 1. Get your API key from https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# 2. Replace the blank after = with your key
# 3. Save this file
# 4. Open the HTML file to start the conversation

# Security Note:
# IMPORTANT: Do not commit your actual API key to version control!
# This template is safe to commit, but once you add your key, 
# be careful not to accidentally commit and push your changes.